{"id":"36fdad15db","t":"The Housekeeper of the Dungeon","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bea4302d-5a89-464b-8510-348b8b847f9a-193x278.webp","n":50,"l":50,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon"},"u":1795038923298,"desc":"عتقد هوينا، المنهكة والمثقلة بالأعباء، أن الزنازين والصيادين لا علاقة لهم بها، إلى أن تُمنح فجأةً قدرات الصيادين. الآن، يتوجب عليها خوض غمار واقعها الجديد الشبيه باللعبة، ولكن بمهارات وإحصائيات… “ربة منزل”؟! مع هذه الفئة الفريدة، تغدو “هوينا” الطاهية والمشرفة والمعتنية المثالية، مما يقودها للحصول على وظيفة تبدو بريئة في إحدى نقابات الصيادين. ولكن، هل ستساعدها هذه المنظمة على جلب ثورة من الراحة والاسترخاء للصيادين، أم ستزج بها في مخاطر لم تكن تتخيلها قط؟ عرض أقل","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيال","رومانسى","كوميدى"],"src":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-housekeeper-of-the-dungeon|/manga/the-h